## 3. Testing Gateway API Endpoints

### Step 1: Direct NodePort Verification

```bash
NODE_IP=$(kubectl get nodes -o jsonpath='{.items[0].status.addresses[?(@.type=="InternalIP")].address}')
curl -s "http://${NODE_IP}:30080/httpbin/get"
```

### Step 2: Testing Header Matches with httpbin-go

```bash
curl -s -H "X-Custom-Header: cka-lab" "http://${NODE_IP}:30080/httpbin/headers"
```
